.TH DEBUG_LINE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
debug_line \- Queue a line for the F3 overlay, like debug_rect()
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqdebug.h\(dq
.BI "void debug_line(float x1, float y1, float x2, float y2, Color c);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Queue a line for the F3 overlay, like debug_rect(). Velocity vectors, aim directions, pathfinding routes, raycasts.
.SH MODULE
debug (src/engine/debug/debug.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR debug_rect (3),
.BR debug_text (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
